<body language="English">
	<row id="msg_0528_T10R0701_00000" index="0">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">Lance: *cape flutters\ndramatically* It’s been a long time\fsince I came in here.\rThis the HALL OF FAME. Where we\nhonor the League Kingpins FOREVER.\rTheir brave homies get inducted\ntoo. The confetti cannon is extra.\rToday, we witnessed the RISE of a\nnew Kingpin--\ra Hustler with love and trust for\nevery single homie.\rA Hustler who made it on PURE grind\nand PURE determination.\rThe new Kingpin with ALL the makings\nof GREATNESS! *single tear*\r{STRVAR_1 3, 0, 0}, lemme register you and\nyour homies as KINGPINS! FOREVER!\f*cape flutters*\r</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0528_T10R0701_00001" index="1">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">Lance: *cape flutters\ndramatically* It’s been a long time\fsince I came in here.\rThis the HALL OF FAME. Where we\nhonor the League Kingpins FOREVER.\rTheir brave homies get inducted\ntoo. The confetti cannon is extra.\rToday, we witnessed the RISE of a\nnew Kingpin--\ra Hustler with love and trust for\nevery single homie.\rA Hustler who made it on PURE grind\nand PURE determination.\rThe new Kingpin with ALL the makings\nof GREATNESS! *single tear*\r{STRVAR_1 3, 0, 0}, lemme register you and\nyour homies as KINGPINS! FOREVER!\f*cape flutters*\r</language>
